WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.035
To add an order yourself, go to Orders, and pick DTP or GMBH at the top.

00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:08.809
Click Actions, then Create order.

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:16.963
Fill in the type, ship date, PO number, PO line number, part number, and ship-to location.

00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:18.774
The quantity is optional.

00:00:19.639 --> 00:00:21.186
Then click Create order.

00:00:21.186 --> 00:00:24.150
The order is listed on Orders with the others.
